  "name": "@eggjs/tegg-mcp-client",
  "readme": "# @eggjs/tegg-mcp-client\n\n## Install\n\n```shell\nnpm i --save @eggjs/tegg-mcp-client\n```\n\n\n## Config\n\n```js\n// config/plugin.js\nexports.mcpClient = {\n  package: '@eggjs/tegg-mcp-client',\n  enable: true,\n};\n```\n",
